ss coverage unavailable.\n\nInspect:\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-data-couchbase-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-04T04-28-21-506976Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-data-couchbase-test:4.1.1/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-10-04T04-23-37-170357Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-data-couchbase-test:4.1.1/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-10-04T04-27-16-391062Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Rewrite the `TestContextManager` scenarios to use `ApplicationContextRunner`/annotation metadata, or add the required generated Spring AOT test support class and resources following the existing `spring-test` fixture.\n2. Clean and rerun coordinate-scoped `javaTest` and `nativeTest` to ensure the native executable is rebuilt and all tests pass.\n3. Regenerate and split metadata, then generate dynamic-access coverage and verify the new-library coverage gate before publication.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_09c122f8feb0b8f4016ac1d6998d9487d18600830bc6e231f2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 2716, "output": 1519, "cacheRead": 147712, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 151947, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791088253236, "responseId": "resp_09c122f8feb0b8f4016ac1d67dddf087d1aca0725a5073f23f", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
